      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk i'm just really scared to go to the hospital right now. i've had migraines that felt pretty bad before, and maybe this is just a combination of stress and dehydration? i feel a bit nauseous too which is normal for me. is there anything i can take at home to help the pain subside so i can just rest for a bit? like maybe a higher dose of something? i really just want to feel better without the whole hospital thing.",
